# 0001. Follow the dataplat conventions

- Status: accepted

## Context

{{ project_name }} is built and operated mostly by coding agents, sometimes in parallel. Conventions
held only in prose drift; conventions encoded as tools hold.

## Decision

Render this repo from the dataplat template and depend on the dataplat library, pinned to a tag.
Platform decisions (single writer on DuckLake, DBOS runtime, LinkML contracts, native graph with parity,
namespaces per worktree, extension pinning) are recorded in dataplat's ADRs. This directory records
decisions specific to {{ project_name }}.

Convention updates arrive with `uvx copier update --trust`. Library updates arrive by bumping the
dataplat tag in `pyproject.toml` and running `uv lock --upgrade-package dataplat`.

## Consequences

Guardrail changes go upstream to dataplat when they apply to every project, or here (owner-reviewed)
when they are specific to this one.
